y rivers and streams."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">NATURE</span>"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img01.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img02.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img03.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img04.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img05.jpg"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br><span class=\"strong\">ANIMALS</span> "}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img06.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img07.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img08.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob06img09.jpg"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " What Are Idioms?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Idioms are expressions which have a meaning apart from what the words themselves mean."}, {"type": "text", "content": "They are very common in spoken English. It is important to know some idioms and to remember that the meaning of the words as a group is different from the words individually."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some idioms:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Idiom </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Meaning </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Keep an eye out for... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Watch for... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Costs an arm and a leg. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Very expensive \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That is a piece of cake. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That is very easy \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Once in a blue moon. \