raph (8 - 10 lines) about it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Be sure to give details and information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read 8-10 sentences about wildlife living in my area."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about geographic features."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my sentences to my partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things to do on a trip."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le17ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le17ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le17ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">John</span>:\nHere we are in beautiful Tigre. I hope you brought your field glasses - there's a lot to see here. Tigre sits on an island that was created by rivers and streams. After lunch, we are taking a vintage mahogany boat through the web of rivers. Be sure to keep an eye out for wildlife in the woods and along the riverbanks. The name Tigre comes from the Spanish word meaning jaguar - don't worry, you won't see any today!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn4le17ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "For those of you who have their bird books, there's a diverse assortment of bird species in Tigre. We are 32 kilometers outside of Buenos Aires, so it is peaceful enough for the birds to breed. You can see some nests if you look closely.", "id": 2, "time": "29500", "image": "engenn4le17ob06re2img02.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "t